=2 Walkthrough
__(information needed)__
----
>**Notes**
* It is not necessary for other party members to be on the mission, however they will not receive notes for its completion.

=2 Objective
Reports indicate that a large battalion of beastmen raiders has been dispatched to {z:Everbloom Hollow}. Travel to the caves via Batallia Downs and aid the knights stationed there in defending the location.
\**Unit Requirement:** 3~6 members
